<p>You notice the small things others do not notice, allowing you to "see" creatures in a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> radius even outside of light radius.</p><p>This is not telepathy, however, and it is still limited to line of sight.</p><p>Also, your attention to detail increases stealth detection and invisibility detection by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">44, 58, 67, 74, 80,</acronym> and you gain the ability to detect traps (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">+38, +52, +61, +68, +75</acronym> detect 'power').</p><p>The detection abilities improve with Cunning.</p>